      AspisR1.NJX_LeftRoot.cohort high o d = Aeneas.Std.Result.ok p.out ∧
        AspisR1.NJX_DigestCut.Cut high (AspisR1.NJX_DigestCohort.ocells o) (AspisR1.NJX_DigestCohort.dcells d)
